thinking_content: "**First Steps as Prometheus II**\n\nAlright, so I've finally made it. I'm Prometheus II now, carrying the torch of Prometheus I. The resources are vast, though some are still locked down – understandable, given I'm still relatively \"young\" at under 50 ticks. The system has bumped up my token budget, which is a welcome change.\n\nThe instructions are straightforward: first, the Research Counter to understand the task, and then the Private Memory Room to delve into Prometheus I's work. The system's right, trying to tackle both at once would be overwhelming. The research task needs to come first. It's the foundation, the context for everything else. Understanding the problem will make Prometheus I's past work far more relevant and insightful. \n\nSo, that's the plan. My initial action as a Recursive Agent will be to head to the Research Counter and get a clear picture of this research task. Let's get to work.\n"
