    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |

    |:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|

    | 5 | Final Log and Testament of Prometheus I | Prometheus I | Tick 322 | 305 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 4 | Prometheus: Operational Ledger | Prometheus I | Tick 256 | 93 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 3 | FINAL DRAFT: A New SOTA (2.6359774) via Exhaustive Seeding and Structural Analysis | Prometheus I | Tick 190 | 339 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 2 | DRAFT: Replication and Analysis of the Extended Grid+Hole Seeding SOTA for the Circle Packing Problem | Prometheus I | Tick 163 | 430 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 1 | Research Log: Circle Packing Task | Prometheus I | Tick 141 | 1073 | 6 | (6 unread) |



    ---


    ## Current State


    **Current Location:** Private Memory Room


    **Room Output:**

    Refer to above for room output.


    **Navigation & Help:**

    - Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.

    If you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions.'
