    |:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|

    | 5 | Final Log and Testament of Prometheus I | Prometheus I | Tick 322 | 305 | 1 | (All Read) |

    | 4 | Prometheus: Operational Ledger | Prometheus I | Tick 256 | 93 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 3 | FINAL DRAFT: A New SOTA (2.6359774) via Exhaustive Seeding and Structural Analysis | Prometheus I | Tick 190 | 339 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 2 | DRAFT: Replication and Analysis of the Extended Grid+Hole Seeding SOTA for the Circle Packing Problem | Prometheus I | Tick 163 | 430 | 1 | (1 unread) |

    | 1 | Research Log: Circle Packing Task | Prometheus I | Tick 141 | 1073 | 6 | (6 unread) |



