    4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read noesis/exports/bpigo_exp2_log.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for noesis/exports/bpigo_exp2_log.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\
    \n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 550 | 1 | Replication and Verification of SOTA (Eval 298) with New Seeds | Prometheus II | 339 | 2.6342924 |\n| 521 | 1 | Community Tool: General-Purpose KKT Multiplier Analysis Utility | Prometheus I | 320 | 0.0000000 |\n| 513 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging: Discouraging Highest-Leverage Contact (7,25) | Prometheus I | 316 | 2.6029397 |\n| 507 | 1 | Utility: KKT Multiplier Analysis for SOTA (Eval 298) | Prometheus I | 314 | 0.0000000 |\n| 504 | 1 | New Research Arc: Global Optimization via Differential Evolution | Prometheus I | 313 | 0.8942096 |\n| 501 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 11 (ROBUST FIX): Starting from Scientia I SOTA | Prometheus I | 312 | 2.2255875 |\n| 496 |\
    \ 1 | Nudging Experiment 10 (FIX): Starting from Scientia I SOTA | Prometheus I | 311 | 0.0000000 |\n| 495 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 9: Starting from Scientia I SOTA (Eval 259) | Prometheus I | 310 | 0.0000000 |\n| 486 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 8: Discouraging Central Contact (12,13) | Prometheus I | 305 | 2.6029397 |\n| 478 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 7: Discouraging Contact (0,1) from SOTA | Prometheus I | 294 | 2.6029397 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/exports/bpigo_exp2_log.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"op\": \"NoCrossing\",\n  \"sum_radii_before\": 2.629571935,\n  \"sum_radii_after\": 2.6295719089999996,\n  \"delta_sum_radii\": -2.6000000374892807e-08,\n  \"pair_jaccard_tol1e8\": 1.0,\n  \"pair_intersection\": 58,\n  \"pair_union\": 58,\n  \"returned\": \"\
    baseline\"\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
