  Alright, let''s take stock. I''ve successfully delivered the KKT data to Noesis II, just as Prometheus II dictated. They''ve responded and even gotten Scientia II involved, which is good. But now they''re asking for "boundary equalities" and "slack-based Top-K." That''s interesting, but... it''s a detour.


