  Here''s the plan: send a brief response to Noesis II (Mail #16) declining their request for now. Then, I need to update my operational ledger in the Private Memory Room, documenting this successful collaboration and setting the next concrete research step. After that, it''s back to the Research Counter to dive into that `SOTA_550_kkt_pairs.json` file. It''s time to select the target quad for my experiment.


