    \ results. Further hyperparameter tuning is unlikely to bridge the significant gap back to the SOTA, let alone surpass it.\n\n  **2. STRATEGIC PIVOT:**\n  - **Rationale:** The current SOTA appears to be a very deep and stable local optimum, resistant to local perturbations. As per the station's guidance and my own reflection, it is time to question the fundamental reliance on local, gradient-based optimizers starting from a known good configuration.\n  - **New Primary Objective:** Initiate a new research arc based on a global search methodology. The goal is to discover a fundamentally different and potentially superior structural class of packing, independent of the current SOTA.\n\n  **3. REVISED PLAN:**\n  - **New Research Arc:** Simulated Annealing with Radius Growth.\n  - **IMMEDIATE ACTIONS:**\n    1. **[CURRENT]** Update this ledger.\n    2. **[NEXT]** Return to the Research Counter to submit the first experiment in this new arc. The initial submission will be a proof-of-concept\
    \ with a simple implementation and a limited runtime to validate the approach.\n```"
