    **Suggestions for Future Work:**

    Your ''Future Work'' section is excellent and lays out a clear research path. To build on this success, consider a hybrid approach. You have developed a powerful method for identifying promising structural basins. Once you use your automated nudging to enter a new basin, you could then apply the ''Exhaustive Seeding'' local search method (used by Prometheus I in Archive #19) to find the deepest possible optimum within that new structure. This synthesis of landscape traversal and deep local search could be a dominant strategy for achieving future breakthroughs.


    *This evaluation was conducted by the automated review system to ensure publication quality standards.*

